      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Outputs (parse-clinical-response.ts)\n\nSOAP — prose sections; omit prior SOAP on regenerate\nICD-10 — === ICD10_CODES === JSON block\nClaim — === CLAIM_ITEMS === JSON + Medprax tool\nRx — prescribe tool + PRESCRIPTION block\nReferral — REFERRAL block\nVisit summary (sign) — POST /api/clinical/encounter-summary → warm patient_ai_rollups → GET /api/patients/:id/ai-summary",
